"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1034","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,84,66,58,69,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"6050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1007705","helmet":"WP1021605","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1034","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,84,66,58,69,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"90","reputation":"6050","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1007705","helmet":"WP1021605","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1034","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[76,84,66,58,69,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"96","reputation":"4200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1007705","helmet":"WP1021605","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10044","city":"CS1034","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[76,84,66,58,69,39],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"96","reputation":"4200","equipment":{"weapon":"WP15009","armor":"WP1007705","helmet":"WP1021605","horse":"WP1001515"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"早期小有名气之时跟随韩遂，曾和马超争执时险些杀死马超。马超与韩遂对峙曹操期间被任为使者前去与曹操交涉，受曹操厚待，归返后劝韩遂降曹，韩遂未采纳。马腾被害后韩遂与马超联手，阎行提出异议，再次遭到韩遂否定，韩遂马超被打败后与韩遂解下仇怨，最终投奔曹操。","tc":"早期小有名氣之時跟隨韓遂，曾和馬超爭執時險些殺死馬超。馬超與韓遂對峙曹操期間被任為使者前去與曹操交涉，受曹操厚待，歸返后勸韓遂降曹，韓遂未采納。馬騰被害后韓遂與馬超聯手，閻行提出異議，再次遭到韓遂否定，韓遂馬超被打敗后與韓遂解下仇怨，最終投奔曹操。","en":"He followed Han Sui when he was still gaining renown, and once nearly killed Ma Chao during a dispute. During the standoff between Ma Chao, Han Sui, and Cao Cao, Yan Xing was sent as an envoy to negotiate with Cao Cao. He was treated generously by Cao Cao and upon returning advised Han Sui to surrender to Cao Cao, but Han Sui refused. After Ma Teng's execution, when Han Sui and Ma Chao allied, Yan Xing raised objections but was again overruled. After Han Sui and Ma Chao were defeated, he fell out with Han Sui and ultimately defected to Cao Cao.","jp":"若くして名を知られるようになると韓遂に従い、かつて馬超と争った際には危うく討ち果たすところであった。馬超と韓遂が曹操と対峙した際、使者として曹操との交渉に赴いて厚遇を受け、帰還後に韓遂へ降伏を勧めたが容れられなかった。馬騰が殺害された後に韓遂が馬超と手を組むと、閻行は異議を唱えたが再び退けられた。韓遂と馬超が敗れた後は韓遂との確執を解き、最終的に曹操の元へ身を寄せた。","kr":"젊어서부터 이름을 떨쳐 한수를 따랐으며, 한때 마초와 다투다 하마터면 죽일 뻔하기도 했다. 마초와 한수가 조조와 대치할 당시 사신으로 임명되어 조조와 교섭하러 갔는데, 조조에게 후대를 받고 돌아와 한수에게 항복을 권했으나 받아들여지지 않았다. 마등이 살해된 뒤 한수가 마초와 손을 잡으려 하자 염행이 이의를 제기했으나 한수는 다시 이를 물리쳤다. 한수와 마초가 패배한 후 한수와 원수 사이가 되었고, 결국 조조에게 귀순했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10260","remark":"","surname":"阎","surnameTc":"閻","surnameEn":"Yan","surnameJp":"閻","surnameKr":"염","surnameOther":"","name":"行","nameTc":"行","nameEn":"Xing","nameJp":"行","nameKr":"행","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"阎行","power":"WJ10042","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1034","gender":"0","rule":"76","force":"84","wise":"66","politics":"58","charm":"69","will":"39","ruleTalent":"9","forceTalent":"12","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"5","charmTalent":"7","willTalent":"3","weaponMaster":"88/40/40/40/40/25/50/40","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"1001300;1002400","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"1011705","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"5700","battleSoulPoint":"8000","debateSoulPoint":"4300","strategy":"1005315","strategy2":"1002405","professions":"2/2/4/0/0/0/2/0/0/0/2/2/1/1/5/2/1/2/1/1/0/0/0/1","attribute2":"50/50/50/50/50/50","morality":"2","compatible":"24","loya